WEBVTT

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:17.590
I know this cold voice

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:22.020
Taking my friend

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:26.800
Maybe a little afraid you'll run away

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.700
But right now...

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:34.720
For this moment in time, I want to hold you tight

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:39.580
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:44.060
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:48.470
I'll take off and break all the way

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.420
For this moment in time, I just wanna be with you

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:57.940
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:02.250
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:06.750
I know I can change all the way

00:01:07.270 --> 00:01:11.830
For the moment...

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:16.030
I just wanna hold you...

00:01:16.130 --> 00:01:25.620
Hanasakeru Seishonen

00:01:37.880 --> 00:01:42.370
I'm back.
 I'm finally back!

00:01:43.550 --> 00:01:44.830
Your Highness Rumaty!

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:53.360
- I am glad that you're back. 
- I'm sorry for worrying you.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:56.710
You have grown into quite a man.

00:01:57.380 --> 00:01:58.840
Get out of my way!

00:02:02.410 --> 00:02:03.370
Sareha?!

00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:10.020
- Please have mercy on me! 
 - Sareha.

00:02:10.280 --> 00:02:15.530
I apologize for all that I have done to you! 
 Please, please...

00:02:15.530 --> 00:02:16.840
Stop it. 
 It's unnecessary.

00:02:18.270 --> 00:02:21.710
I'm telling you again. 
 I didn't come here to take revenge.

00:02:22.510 --> 00:02:27.000
After I find out the truth, punishment will be handed down according to the law.

00:02:27.380 --> 00:02:31.970
- By the law? 
- Right. Raginei is going to be a country ruled by law.

00:02:32.700 --> 00:02:35.600
Those who took the country into their own hands will...

00:02:36.020 --> 00:02:39.300
...be punished according to the law.

00:02:40.510 --> 00:02:41.970
This can't be.

00:02:44.940 --> 00:02:49.490
- Is my brother in the Palace? 
- I don't know.

00:02:49.750 --> 00:02:55.070
- Me neither. 
- You don't know where the king you serve is at?!

00:02:55.580 --> 00:03:01.470
- But... 
- We were initially on your side, Your Highness.  - Quiet!

00:03:02.550 --> 00:03:05.070
- It is because there are people like you! 
 - Your Highness.

00:03:07.580 --> 00:03:12.390
I understand. You guys stay here. 
 Kajika. Lee-Leng.

00:03:21.890 --> 00:03:24.750
I always wanted to come in here.

00:03:26.250 --> 00:03:29.690
- Rumaty. 
- Every time the chamberlains stopped me...

00:03:30.550 --> 00:03:33.190
...I realized how weak my position as the second in line was.

00:03:34.920 --> 00:03:39.980
But--- there is no one that will stop me now!

00:03:40.430 --> 00:03:42.530
That is what it means to become king!

00:03:42.910 --> 00:03:46.610
To take responsibility for every action!

00:03:59.030 --> 00:04:04.090
- Quinza?! 
- Your Highness.

00:04:05.910 --> 00:04:10.810
For Eternity

00:04:15.620 --> 00:04:19.480
- Quinza. 
- <i>So, he was alive.</i>

00:04:20.660 --> 00:04:26.490
<i>He must be badly hurt.</i>
 Quinza! Lee-Leng?!

00:04:27.860 --> 00:04:32.350
<i>I can tell that he's barely conscious by the way he looks.</i>

00:04:34.510 --> 00:04:37.320
I was waiting for your arrival.

00:04:37.920 --> 00:04:40.980
Quinza. 
 I will talk to you later.

00:04:41.710 --> 00:04:45.090
- I want to see my brother. Lead the way. 
- No.

00:04:45.570 --> 00:04:49.550
- I need you to hear me out on something right now. 
- What is it?

00:04:50.410 --> 00:04:52.070
<i>What is he going to tell him?!</i>

00:04:53.910 --> 00:04:56.650
As you have suspected, the last two years...

00:04:57.350 --> 00:05:00.120
...I ran the country the way I wanted to.

00:05:01.050 --> 00:05:04.520
- You---
 - But before that...

00:05:04.870 --> 00:05:07.390
...the Palace was controlled by the chamberlains.

00:05:08.760 --> 00:05:14.270
They controlled the king with lies and received bribes to increase their own wealth.

00:05:15.860 --> 00:05:20.610
When I saw that, I realized, if they can do it...

00:05:22.550 --> 00:05:25.190
...I can do it better!

00:05:26.950 --> 00:05:29.270
<i>Quinza, you!</i>

00:05:29.780 --> 00:05:35.450
I've heard that the king was diagnosed with cancer.

00:05:36.760 --> 00:05:41.600
And the chamberlains were trying to lead him to euthanasia.

00:05:42.270 --> 00:05:46.700
If they put King Somand on the throne, it would be easier to carry out their plan.

00:05:47.620 --> 00:05:49.660
The sooner, the better.

00:05:50.230 --> 00:05:55.900
It can't be! 
 Chamberlains killing a royalty?! Them killing my father?!

00:05:56.670 --> 00:06:01.380
- No way! 
- Why do you think when you were outside of the country...

00:06:01.640 --> 00:06:07.180
...King Woold passed away and the suspicion of assassination was put on you?

00:06:07.530 --> 00:06:11.060
- What?!  
- Everything was to put you at fault.

00:06:11.510 --> 00:06:13.580
It was conspired by both the chamberlains and me.

00:06:14.410 --> 00:06:20.330
It was a trap that I laid out in order to control this country.

00:06:20.650 --> 00:06:25.140
- That's a lie! It's not true Quinza! 
- Kajika!

00:06:26.320 --> 00:06:28.390
- Take this. 
 - What is that?

00:06:28.840 --> 00:06:32.790
This is the list of those who conspired along with me.

00:06:33.490 --> 00:06:38.300
I've added those who took the country into their own hands.

00:06:39.410 --> 00:06:42.030
You're trying to betray your comrades?!

00:06:43.330 --> 00:06:48.370
It will be unfair for me to take all the blame.

00:06:50.750 --> 00:06:53.430
Please, take this.

00:06:56.460 --> 00:06:58.340
Take this Your Highness!

00:06:58.970 --> 00:07:03.910
Those listed here brought about great distress to this country and its people.

00:07:04.390 --> 00:07:09.710
They were the ones trying to lead this holy nation in the wrong direction.

00:07:10.340 --> 00:07:14.360
The one who is to become king must not overlook this fact.

00:07:15.510 --> 00:07:18.530
This is your duty!

00:07:32.320 --> 00:07:36.150
<i>This is the way it should be, Your Highness.</i>

00:07:38.120 --> 00:07:41.820
Now I have more company to go to hell along with me.

00:07:42.140 --> 00:07:46.400
Everyone will be punished according to the law. 
 The death penalty is not automatically given!

00:07:48.090 --> 00:07:51.530
- How unfortunate. 
- Quinza!

00:07:53.090 --> 00:07:55.200
<i>He's trying to take all the blame...</i>

00:07:55.900 --> 00:07:59.430
<i>...and take down all those who might become His Highness' enemy.</i>

00:08:00.360 --> 00:08:04.080
To make sure no one gets away with the crime they committed with His Highness' mercy.

00:08:05.990 --> 00:08:10.170
- Quinza?! 
- I will not obey the law.

00:08:10.930 --> 00:08:14.560
I've lost my bet in life.

00:08:17.720 --> 00:08:18.800
You---

00:08:20.680 --> 00:08:23.900
<i>I wanted to see a little bit more...</i>

00:08:25.870 --> 00:08:27.050
<i>...more of you...</i>

00:08:31.190 --> 00:08:32.750
<i>...I wanted to...</i>

00:08:36.510 --> 00:08:41.580
<i>I don't have time! 
I have none left.</i>

00:08:46.450 --> 00:08:52.120
<i>Your Highness, this is all that I can do for you...</i>

00:08:53.420 --> 00:08:57.150
<i>...is to act as the villain.</i>

00:08:57.660 --> 00:09:02.630
<i>A villain that everyone will notice.</i>

00:09:04.410 --> 00:09:09.130
<i>Your Highness, you'll run towards me?!</i>

00:09:10.630 --> 00:09:14.670
<i>Your Highness, you'll run to me? To Quinza?</i>

00:09:15.340 --> 00:09:20.150
<i>You running towards me...</i>

00:09:22.410 --> 00:09:23.970
<i>...that's all I needed.</i>

00:09:26.840 --> 00:09:30.090
- Quinza! 
- Don't come near!

00:09:30.630 --> 00:09:33.880
- No one come close! 
- Quinza!

00:09:36.870 --> 00:09:38.020
Your Highness.

00:09:40.860 --> 00:09:43.660
Rumaty, what's going to happen with Quinza?!

00:09:53.340 --> 00:09:54.490
Your Highness.

00:10:03.250 --> 00:10:06.150
Quinza. 
 Listen.

00:10:08.920 --> 00:10:10.510
I will allow you to die.

00:10:16.280 --> 00:10:23.060
Die for the royalty and me!

00:10:23.090 --> 00:10:25.040
Your Highness.

00:10:26.280 --> 00:10:30.170
You'll give that kind of honor, to me?!

00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:36.760
I want to see your face...

00:10:38.160 --> 00:10:43.580
...again. One more time.

00:10:59.030 --> 00:11:04.540
- Make a wish? 
- Yea! If you make a wish it'll come true!

00:11:04.760 --> 00:11:09.030
- That's what people say? 
- No, I just came up with it right now!

00:11:09.600 --> 00:11:12.720
It emits such a beautiful light. 
 It'll come true!

00:11:13.810 --> 00:11:18.110
You're right. 
 My wish hasn't changed for a long time.

00:11:18.810 --> 00:11:23.240
- You only have one wish? 
- Yes.

00:11:25.460 --> 00:11:29.100
God, please...

00:11:30.180 --> 00:11:32.030
...bring glory to my king.

00:11:33.720 --> 00:11:37.820
May you bless him for eternity.

00:11:37.820 --> 00:11:42.790
Hanasakeru Seishonen

00:12:00.030 --> 00:12:05.220
Wow! It's only been a few days but he seems like he got more mature.

00:12:08.050 --> 00:12:10.380
This seems like a dream.

00:12:11.560 --> 00:12:17.360
I didn't think that this would happen when we saw Somand's coronation.

00:12:18.060 --> 00:12:20.190
Director Harry probably wanted to be here.

00:12:20.670 --> 00:12:25.350
He has work. Even if he comes right now he won't be able to chat with Rumaty.

00:12:26.530 --> 00:12:30.480
On top of that, Dad probably knew it was going to turn out like this.

00:12:31.790 --> 00:12:35.540
- That Rumaty would become the king. 
- Really?

00:12:36.090 --> 00:12:39.140
Well, he might be able to pull that off.

00:12:41.530 --> 00:12:47.520
<i>I'm probably right. He has the potential, so Dad probably chose him as one of the candidates.</i>

00:12:48.030 --> 00:12:53.640
<i>Wait a minute! 
 Would he be a proper candidate?!</i>

00:12:54.310 --> 00:12:58.960
He's my cousin and he'll become a king ruling the country.

00:12:59.240 --> 00:13:05.230
There are strict rules to him picking his wife. 
 Wait, Eugene too.

00:13:05.740 --> 00:13:08.930
He was never considering marriage in the first place.

00:13:09.880 --> 00:13:14.850
Carl too. If he thinks about the rivalry with Burnsworth and his family...

00:13:15.110 --> 00:13:18.040
...he's not the one I can marry easily.

00:13:19.090 --> 00:13:23.520
So I couldn't get married easily to any one of them?

00:13:24.500 --> 00:13:27.630
- But, why did Dad---
- Kajika.

00:13:29.350 --> 00:13:33.740
What's wrong? Let's go. Rumaty is expecting your presence.

00:13:36.070 --> 00:13:39.380
- I'm going to go Toranosuke. 
- Yes.

00:13:39.670 --> 00:13:43.360
- What were you pondering about? 
- Wow, they are so picturesque.

00:13:43.930 --> 00:13:46.100
Eugene-san must be having a hard time.

00:13:48.240 --> 00:13:53.870
- It's more quiet inside than I thought. 
- Well, the coronation ceremony is supposed to be like this.

00:13:55.240 --> 00:13:57.280
Master Kajika! Lee-Leng!

00:14:00.790 --> 00:14:03.810
Oh, Isaac! You're wearing your uniform!

00:14:04.030 --> 00:14:07.250
I was promoted and I'm now a major.

00:14:07.380 --> 00:14:10.600
Wow! Congratulations! 
 You look great!

00:14:10.980 --> 00:14:13.210
It's an honor. 
 Thank you very much.

00:14:13.750 --> 00:14:15.660
You seem so distant now.

00:14:16.740 --> 00:14:20.060
You're so formal. 
 You can act casual.

00:14:20.340 --> 00:14:22.640
Well, it's my personality.

00:14:23.560 --> 00:14:27.610
Excuse me. 
 Are you Master Lee-Leng Huang?

00:14:28.020 --> 00:14:31.750
- Yea. 
- You have a guest. Please come this way.

00:14:31.940 --> 00:14:36.720
- A guest? 
- I'm going to go see Rumaty.

00:14:38.020 --> 00:14:40.890
Please come this way. 
 His Highness is waiting.

00:14:52.390 --> 00:14:55.320
- Yes, if there is anything that you need---
- Kajika?

00:14:56.310 --> 00:14:58.920
- Can you give us a minute? 
- Yes, sir.

00:14:59.170 --> 00:15:02.330
- Rumaty! 
- What's wrong? Did something happen?

00:15:04.180 --> 00:15:09.460
- All of a sudden, you seem like someone great! 
- I'm the same as usual.

00:15:15.990 --> 00:15:19.620
- Your Highness, may I have a word? 
- What is it?

00:15:19.980 --> 00:15:24.280
Yes, sir. 
 I didn't know if I should give this to you now but...

00:15:26.410 --> 00:15:28.960
- What is that? 
- It's a letter from Sezun.

00:15:29.880 --> 00:15:33.960
- Sezun? Did you tell him about Quinza? 
- Yes.

00:15:37.720 --> 00:15:39.660
It says that he'll become a priest.

00:15:41.860 --> 00:15:45.550
Yes, he told me when he brought this to me.

00:15:46.570 --> 00:15:51.920
He told me to apologize for his disrespect for not appearing before you.

00:15:53.580 --> 00:15:57.470
Tell His Highness that I am grateful from the bottom of my heart.

00:15:58.260 --> 00:16:03.390
I will spend my whole life to ask for forgiveness from God for all the sins that my brother has committed.

00:16:04.090 --> 00:16:06.510
You're going to head to the Potsulys Monestary as I suspected.

00:16:07.020 --> 00:16:11.830
Yes, sir. 
 That monastery is the strictest of the Ragi Church.

00:16:12.880 --> 00:16:16.130
- I don't think we'll be able to see each other again. 
- Is that so.

00:16:17.060 --> 00:16:22.630
Please don't look sad. 
 Although it was a rough time, I had a lot of fun.

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:27.190
And someone like I can help you guys.

00:16:29.420 --> 00:16:32.790
- I was able to have all the fun I can in a lifetime. 
- Sezun---

00:16:38.020 --> 00:16:40.020
Farewell.

00:16:51.520 --> 00:16:55.510
- Sezun. 
- Was he really alright with the choice he made?

00:16:56.750 --> 00:17:01.370
There are many that died and got imprisoned for what Quinza did...

00:17:02.670 --> 00:17:08.220
...if I thought about the suffering of those people, I should not have given him the honor to die.

00:17:09.270 --> 00:17:10.350
You're right.

00:17:13.500 --> 00:17:16.340
But, I think you did the right thing.

00:17:17.740 --> 00:17:21.590
- Kajika? 
- Because, Quinza was already...

00:17:21.910 --> 00:17:27.070
...judging and punishing himself. 
 What he needed at that time was...

00:17:27.770 --> 00:17:29.720
...forgiveness. That's all.

00:17:34.590 --> 00:17:37.550
I can't help it, but I think she is right.

00:17:38.380 --> 00:17:41.250
That's why Sezun showed his gratitude to you, Your Highness.

00:17:41.890 --> 00:17:46.220
And now he's off to seek forgiveness for the sins of his brother.

00:17:47.970 --> 00:17:51.120
So, that was the only road he can take.

00:17:51.950 --> 00:17:57.140
Yes, sir. 
 That man Quinza, didn't want to let go of control of anything.

00:17:58.260 --> 00:18:02.400
All I felt for him was anger and pity.

00:18:03.230 --> 00:18:08.170
As a man, I also felt some envy towards him.

00:18:23.550 --> 00:18:29.000
How disrespectful of you to make me wait, Zao.

00:18:31.100 --> 00:18:34.130
I apologize. 
 But...

00:18:34.290 --> 00:18:37.470
...I was waiting for you too, Master Lee-Leng.

00:18:41.070 --> 00:18:44.420
You've reached the time limit, Master Lee-Leng.

00:18:46.840 --> 00:18:48.080
I know.

00:18:51.840 --> 00:18:52.920
To your brother?

00:18:55.400 --> 00:18:59.510
I told him that I wanted to protect him. 
And he hugged me and didn't let go.

00:19:05.340 --> 00:19:09.800
He stopped shaking and showed me a smile behind those cold eyes.

00:19:12.640 --> 00:19:15.630
- Is that right? 
- I still have time.

00:19:16.910 --> 00:19:22.480
I thought I wouldn't be able to save him, but I still have time.

00:19:24.110 --> 00:19:27.550
Right, as long as you don't give up.

00:19:30.160 --> 00:19:30.990
Kajika.

00:19:32.930 --> 00:19:36.240
Is it OK if I don't give up on you?

00:19:38.120 --> 00:19:41.560
I've still sworn on the holiness.

00:19:43.000 --> 00:19:44.680
I'm still considering you as my Queen.

00:19:46.150 --> 00:19:48.380
Unchanging, even to this day.

00:19:50.640 --> 00:19:53.570
Are my words reaching you?

00:19:56.150 --> 00:19:57.900
Are my feelings getting across to you?

00:20:02.680 --> 00:20:03.730
Yes, I hear you.

00:20:05.960 --> 00:20:09.180
I'm sorry that I couldn't respond to it.

00:20:11.700 --> 00:20:15.230
- Kajika.
- I wasn't running away.

00:20:17.210 --> 00:20:23.200
I really didn't know.
 I really liked everyone. Rumaty, Carl, and Eugene.

00:20:24.370 --> 00:20:26.090
I didn't know what to do.

00:20:27.110 --> 00:20:30.940
It's such a warm feeling to fall in love.

00:20:31.380 --> 00:20:35.010
I really liked falling in love.

00:20:35.750 --> 00:20:39.600
I didn't want to pick who was number one. 
 I just liked you guys.

00:20:40.110 --> 00:20:44.820
I liked them all like Mustafa, Dad, Maria, rain, wind, and trees.

00:20:47.880 --> 00:20:50.180
But, now I'm starting to realize...

00:20:50.910 --> 00:20:53.710
..that there is a "special one" among them.

00:20:55.460 --> 00:21:00.780
That there is a special and one of a kind "love" that no one can change.

00:21:03.300 --> 00:21:05.660
It's not me?

00:21:09.700 --> 00:21:14.320
I knew it ever since I found out Lee-Leng loved you.

00:21:16.040 --> 00:21:19.510
- That this day would come. 
-  I'm sorry.

00:21:20.210 --> 00:21:23.080
But I want to stay as best friends with you!

00:21:23.560 --> 00:21:26.870
<i>That's the reason why I wanted you to become the Queen.</i>

00:21:27.990 --> 00:21:30.120
<i>I always wanted you to be by my side.</i>

00:21:31.750 --> 00:21:33.620
A ruler must bear the solitude.

00:21:33.970 --> 00:21:38.500
In order to lead people, you must learn how to withstand isolation.

00:21:38.980 --> 00:21:40.890
I don't know what you're talking about!

00:21:42.890 --> 00:21:46.240
I'm sorry. Now I truly understand.

00:21:48.950 --> 00:21:52.260
<i>- Quinza. </i>
- Rumaty?

00:21:52.830 --> 00:21:55.800
- Can you go back to your room? 
 I'll be there in a little bit. - OK

00:22:01.050 --> 00:22:03.950
Am I really going to be isolated?

00:22:04.870 --> 00:22:09.010
Kajika and Lee-Leng are going back to where they came from.

00:22:10.380 --> 00:22:12.550
They're not going to be here, but elsewhere.

00:22:23.700 --> 00:22:24.880
Isn't it great?

00:22:27.840 --> 00:22:33.000
I would have wanted you around on a day like this, Quinza.

00:22:39.340 --> 00:22:40.710
It's beautiful.

00:22:44.910 --> 00:22:46.630
It's really pretty!

00:22:50.710 --> 00:22:51.640
Brother.

00:22:55.780 --> 00:22:57.500
Is there something you want to make a wish for?

00:23:01.610 --> 00:23:08.380
I can't stand feeling this distance,

00:23:09.150 --> 00:23:16.210
So I'm starting to search for your heart.

00:23:16.700 --> 00:23:22.790
Because you were always at my side, protecting me.

00:23:23.450 --> 00:23:28.020
And I'm afraid of being alone.

00:23:30.240 --> 00:23:37.280
Though it's been a long time, everyone's just the same.

00:23:37.560 --> 00:23:44.720
Whether sleeping now, or crying, I want to see your smiling face.

00:23:44.720 --> 00:23:52.240
Because I will love you, with heart overflowing.

00:23:52.240 --> 00:23:59.330
Don't turn away, look at me. I believe in you.

00:23:59.910 --> 00:24:06.860
So, no one else knows our secret thoughts

00:24:07.250 --> 00:24:14.240
The blue sea of a strong and beautiful time.

00:24:14.590 --> 00:24:24.380
In those arms, in that embrace, I'm alive.
